{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le16ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "Dear Janet,<br /><br />\nI am applying for work at BFP as an editorial assistant and I was wondering if I could ask for a letter of reference. I would have written to you earlier, but I have been quite busy. They are going to need a little information about what I did for you as an intern at Polygon. They are also going to want some specific details and perhaps a brief description of some of the skills I developed while working there.\nThey need it by the end of the week if that's alright. I'm volunteering in your area on Thursday, could I swing by your office and pick the letter up in the afternoon? Would that be ok?<br /><br />Thanks again,<br />\nKristi", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob08re2img06.jpg", "text": "<br />Dear Kristi,<br /><br />\nI would be happy to write you a letter of recommendation, just send me the information about the company and I will write it up today. No need to come in to get it. I'll e-mail it to you.<br /><br />Regards,<br />\nJanet", "id": 2, "time": "41000"}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob08re2img07.jpg", "text": "<br />It is with great pleasure and confidence that I offer this recommendation on behalf of Ms. Kristi Lenard as I know her to be an enthusiastic and diligent employee. As her direct supervisor at Polygon in Boston, I found Kristi to be a great asset to the organization. Albeit a newer addition to the staff, she always handled herself with poise and confidence. Her great flexibility enabled her to successfully learn and become very capable with several of our software packages. As a copy editor, I found Kristi's writing skills to be impeccable and Kristi always fulfilled her administrative obligations in a timely and professional manner. Furthermore, her pleasant demeanor and sociable nature made her a definite asset in the staff room. I unhesitatingly offer my highest recommendation for Kristi as an excellent copywriter, a dedicated professional, a receptive and diligent employee and an affable and highly collaborative colleague.\nIn my opinion, hiring Kristi would be a no-brainer.", "id": 3, "time": "57000"}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn9le16ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> How do you write a letter of reccomendation? </span>", "id": 1, "time": "27900"}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> Why are examples important?</span>", "id": 2, "time": "126000"}]}}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can write about events and experiences related to jobs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write about future plans.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write a recommendation letter.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What do you admire about your best friend?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What skills do you feel your friend has that would transfer into the workplace?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": 