br/> <span class=\"bullet\"></span>Write a closing line.\n<br/> <span class=\"bullet\"></span>Use formal language and complete sentences.\n<br/><span class=\"bullet\"></span>When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the <span class=\"strong\">Go to Writing Task</span> button.</span>\n<br/> <br/>  <span class=\"strong\">Reference letter</span> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "You are done!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Let's review your reference letter.</span>\n", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your reference letter should include:\n<ul> <li>Formal language\n</li> <li>Complete sentences</li>\n <li>The structure of the reference letter (city and date, salutation, introduction, paragraphs, closing sentence, closing line, signature)</li>\n </ul>\n ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your reference letter for spelling, grammar and punctuation errors.\n", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Click the <span class=\"strong\">Submit</span>  button to save your letter.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "grading_chart", "grading_contents": {"body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "element": "th", "points": "20", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text"}, {"content": [" "], "el